    "chunk_text": "en wunde & banwyrt seo \u00fee h\u00e6bbe croppan, gecnua \u00fea wyrta twa, wyl on Drenc wi\u00f0 lungenadle, genim hindheolo\u00fean leaf & hindbergean & garclifan, heopbremles leaf, wyl Wi\u00fe lungenadle, hindbergean leaf & hreodes spir, reade hofan, bisceopwyrt, dolhrunan, neftan, on Wi\u00fe lungenadle wyrc sealfe on buteran & \u00feige on meolcum, nim brunewyrt, meodowyrt, bercrago, Wi\u00fe lungenadle, brunewyrt, cneowholen, betonica, wudumerce, sure, eoforfearn, acumba, garclife, Genim eoforfearn, gecnuwa & awylle on butran, do \u00fea sealfe on awyllede gate meoluc & \u00feicge on Drenc wi\u00fe drigre lungenne, holen rinde & V leafan, dile & redic gecnua to duste & of geot mid Eft, drenc, marubian & betonican, merce, rude, surapuldre rinde, slah \u00feorn winde, drince on eala\u00f0. Briw wi\u00fe lungenadle, ontran, eolonan, marubian, wenwyrt \u00fea clifihtan, rude, merce, pipor, hunig. Wi\u00fe drigre lungenne, of wealwyrte moran & of fleo\u00fean wyrte, hunan, diles s\u00e6d, seo\u00fe on butran, Eft, nim alres rinde, seo\u00fe on w\u00e6tre o\u00fe \u00fe\u00e6t \u00fe\u00e6s w\u00e6teres sie \u00feriddan d\u00e6l onbewylled, sele \u00feonne Wi\u00fe lungen wunde, \u00fe\u00e6s blacan ifiges croppena & corna, \u00e6rest \u00fereo on d\u00e6g, V on morgene, seofan Eft wi\u00fe lung",
